    {
        "id": "d0beb11c-169e-4f3d-8b23-795467ba84dc",
        "build_id": "9ee46ad5-a3de-455a-8275-1c6049f7abc6",
        "round_number": 4,
        "cash_earned": 0,
        "created_at": "2025-07-31T04:45:33.610566+00:00",
        "notes": "Grabbing [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e) and [Potent Projectiles](item_7e9a8017-9458-4318-aea9-5e80ba7e3c46) on round 4 should set us up quite nicely for the rest of the game.\n\n[Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e) is seriously such a great perk. It gives Ana a huge amount of mobility, which combined with the extra health from [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e), makes you very hard to kill. If you're like me you can also bind jump to your scroll wheel and b-hop around the map like a dork.\n\nI would put the rest of your money into [Potent Projectiles](item_7e9a8017-9458-4318-aea9-5e80ba7e3c46) and whatever extra weapon power perks you can afford.",
