        "created_at": "2025-07-31T04:45:33.610566+00:00",
        "notes": "For your power on round 5 I would stick with [No Scope Needed](item_823db5eb-5a24-4bac-b850-0aa34e76b4f6).\n\nNow, this is where I start to deviate from the original build. It's a little more expensive, but I would recommend selling [Potent Projectiles](item_7e9a8017-9458-4318-aea9-5e80ba7e3c46) and picking up [Unscoped Resources](item_64c401f6-7508-4fc7-ac3a-93c9f3f57e2b). Now that it gives 15% WP this seems like a great upgrade to me. Switch up your playstyle to always shoot unscoped shots and you'll never have to reload.\n\nThe real heat I'm trying to cook up with this build however comes from [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448). This is because ***dash boots procs it!!!*** This was a game changer for me when I first found out. Whether you're following up after a sleep/nade or trying to keep your teammates healthy as you reposition, this gives you an instant +5 WP like every 3 seconds.\n\nFinally, if you can't afford both Unscoped Resources and Hardlight Accelerator, just buy whatever weapon power perks you can.",
